<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>EDO and QR Code Ready for Download</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #17a2b8; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa; }
        .details { background-color: white; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
        .download-info { background-color: #d4edda; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #28a745; border-radius: 5px; }
        .important { background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; }
        .qr-code { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background-color: white; border-radius: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎫 EDO and QR Code Ready!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{ trucker.fullName }},</p>
            
            <p><strong>Excellent news!</strong> Your Electronic Delivery Order (EDO) and QR code are now ready for download.</p>
            
            <div class="download-info">
                <h3>📥 Download Information:</h3>
                <p><strong>EDO Number:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.edoNumber }}</p>
                <p><strong>QR Code:</strong> Available in your trucker dashboard</p>
                <p><strong>Status:</strong> Ready for terminal access</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="details">
                <h3>Container Return Details:</h3>
                <p><strong>Reference Number:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.id }}</p>
                <p><strong>Container Number:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.container.containerNumber }}</p>
                <p><strong>Terminal:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.selectedTerminal.name }} ({{ preAdviceRequest.selectedTerminal.type.value }})</p>
                {% if preAdviceRequest.assignedSlot %}
                <p><strong>Assigned Slot:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.assignedSlot.date|date('Y-m-d') }}</p>
                {% endif %}
                <p><strong>Terminal Location:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.selectedTerminal.location }}</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="important">
                <h3>⚠️ Before You Go:</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Download your QR code</strong> from the trucker dashboard</li>
                    <li><strong>Print the QR code</strong> - digital copies may not scan properly</li>
                    <li><strong>Bring printed QR code</strong> to the terminal entrance</li>
                    <li><strong>Verify container details</strong> match your booking</li>
                    <li><strong>Check terminal operating hours</strong> before departure</li>
                    {% if preAdviceRequest.assignedSlot %}
                    <li><strong>Arrive during your slot time:</strong> {{ preAdviceRequest.assignedSlot.date|date('Y-m-d') }}</li>
                    {% endif %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="details">
                <h3>🚛 At the Terminal:</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>Present your printed QR code at the entrance gate</li>
                    <li>Security will scan and verify your code</li>
                    <li>Follow terminal staff instructions for container positioning</li>
                    <li>Complete the container return process</li>
                    <li>Obtain return receipt from terminal staff</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            
            <div class="details">
                <h3>📞 Need Help?</h3>
                <p>If you encounter any issues:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Contact the terminal directly for on-site assistance</li>
                    <li>Call our support team for technical issues</li>
                    <li>Check your dashboard for updated information</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>Log into your trucker dashboard now to download your QR code and complete your container return preparation.</strong></p>
            
            <p>Thank you for using OPTIMUS Terminal FREE-ADVICE System. Safe travels!</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from OPTIMUS Shipping Portal.<br>
            Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>